# Secrets — see supabase/SETUP.md §2.
#
# Two files, two audiences:
#   .env          Flutter. BUNDLED INTO THE APP as an asset — public values only.
#   backend/.env  Python. Holds SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET and GEMINI_API_KEY.
#
# These patterns have no slash, so they match at any depth and cover both.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python backend
backend/.venv/
backend/__pycache__/
backend/**/__pycache__/
backend/.pytest_cache/
backend/.ruff_cache/

*.md 
/skills